{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvQXdheSUyMCUyODIwMjAlMjkv","type":"series","name":"Away","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/lkT776mSvQ9wZ8wkYsnpQuogp10.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vn0QIrNW5suBiF8BXnbp1r27guN.jpg","description":"American astronaut Emma Green must leave her husband and teenage daughter behind to command an international space crew embarking upon a treacherous mission. A series about hope, humanity and how we need one another if we are to achieve impossible things.\n\nRated TV-14 · Canceled · First aired 4 Sept 2020 · United States of America · Language: English · 60 min\nStudio: True Jack Productions, 6th & Idaho Motion Picture Company, Universal Television · Network: Netflix\n\nComplete series. On your server: S1 10/10\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2020","genres":["Sci-Fi & Fantasy","Drama","English"],"videos":[{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvQXdheSUyMCUyODIwMjAlMjkv.1.1","title":"Go","season":1,"episode":1,"released":"2020-09-04T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"As the mission launches, Emma finds her mettle as commander tested by an onboard accident, a divided crew and a family emergency back on Earth.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zT9VLzbhAP3juCFoxbJxZsnfjNH.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvQXdheSUyMCUyODIwMjAlMjkv.1.2","title":"Negative Return","season":1,"episode":2,"released":"2020-09-04T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"When a ship malfunction threatens the voyage before it's barely begun, Emma works with a wary Misha on a high-risk repair operation.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xS5rh7nxoK7sORbu6NFdiuYxwN8.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvQXdheSUyMCUyODIwMjAlMjkv.1.3","title":"Half the Sky","season":1,"episode":3,"released":"2020-09-04T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"A staff change at Mission Control upsets the usually unflappable Lu, and the fallout undermines Emma's command. Matt encourages Lex to return to school.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/un41PCChQdDlScjU1DeNFl23u0P.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvQXdheSUyMCUyODIwMjAlMjkv.1.4","title":"Excellent Chariots","season":1,"episode":4,"released":"2020-09-04T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Emma puts herself in harm's way when Ram unwittingly endangers the lives of everyone on the Atlas. Matt must make a wrenching decision about his future.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yKZrEa5OQ95qCT8PDWYfXOShaIX.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvQXdheSUyMCUyODIwMjAlMjkv.1.5","title":"Space Dogs","season":1,"episode":5,"released":"2020-09-04T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"As Christmas approaches, the crew prepares to make their final calls home before communication grows spotty. Matt and Lex adjust to their new normal.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/msDcG217Xqey30EJfIeXyoWdUgf.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvQXdheSUyMCUyODIwMjAlMjkv.1.6","title":"A Little Faith","season":1,"episode":6,"released":"2020-09-04T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Tempers flare on the Atlas over a water-system glitch and an act of betrayal. As Matt works on the ship's issue, he accidentally meets Lex's new friend.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lpQYYe1dngAataKBXKUr1bl2ckX.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvQXdheSUyMCUyODIwMjAlMjkv.1.7","title":"Goodnight Mars","season":1,"episode":7,"released":"2020-09-04T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Emma's behavior becomes a cause for concern, Kwesi and Lu team up on a plant mystery, and Lex makes an impulsive decision with far-reaching consequences.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dRbHljjd1aXD6lz7ZU2uURrNQIk.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvQXdheSUyMCUyODIwMjAlMjkv.1.8","title":"Vital Signs","season":1,"episode":8,"released":"2020-09-04T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"A problem with Atlas' supply ship jeopardizes the mission and sparks questions about Emma's commitment to landing on Mars.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pvkb8raBJGHxUcHIoIK2HAVmh1b.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvQXdheSUyMCUyODIwMjAlMjkv.1.9","title":"Spektr","season":1,"episode":9,"released":"2020-09-04T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Emotions run high as rapidly dwindling water rations on the Atlas leave the crew and Mission Control scrambling to find a fix before time runs out.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9umqZSOFdGguamNCJ9AKwxoChv9.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvQXdheSUyMCUyODIwMjAlMjkv.1.10","title":"Home","season":1,"episode":10,"released":"2020-09-04T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"With only hours to go before Atlas' planned touchdown on Mars, Emma is confronted with everything that could go wrong, while Lu receives new orders.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aG8Kc18qapV2HvwIqk1sCHDt6Je.jpg"}],"imdbRating":"6.5","runtime":"60 min","cast":["Hilary Swank","Mark Ivanir","Ray Panthaki","Vivian Wu","Ato Essandoh","Talitha Eliana Bateman"],"director":["Andrew Hinderaker"],"released":"2020-09-04T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"Home can never leave you.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Andrew Hinderaker","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/cP3H9EKhvBzkG3Bsh1tOz6VFY3Q.jpg"},{"name":"Hilary Swank","character":"Emma Green","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/uin6aAehUGpPCiJCaSjZG8B7M7d.jpg"},{"name":"Mark Ivanir","character":"Misha","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/1kxGAsP4YRiR7LgmlM9KgtekMLk.jpg"},{"name":"Ray Panthaki","character":"Ram",